Bestiary: {
	AncientSmith: A smith from the lost Alloyan civilization, skilled in warfare, metallurgy, and art.
	AncientTroop: An ancient Alloyan war machine, still carrying out orders whose purpose has long been forgotten.
	AncientTrooper_Melee: An Alloyan soldier awakened alongside the ancient war machine.
	AncientTrooper_Ranged: An Alloyan archer awakened alongside the ancient war machine.
	YaZi: One of the nine sons of the dragon, born with an unending hunger for battle.
}
